coming its challenges. Unlock new items, Rogumon, and other ways of strengthening your team. Perhaps you might even find a way to convince the fearsome bosses that oppose you to rally to your cause\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157550/extras/c824a92b552d7744d76ae619d8ad0956.poster.avif?t=1753473034\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157550/extras/c824a92b552d7744d76ae619d8ad0956.webm?t=1753473034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157550/extras/c824a92b552d7744d76ae619d8ad0956.mp4?t=1753473034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop relationships:</strong> Despite being cast from Paradise, you are certainly not alone \u2013 for better or for worse. Meet the other denizens of the afterlife, and learn more of their stories. Whether they wish to help you, hinder you, or both, you\u2019ll discover more about them as you continue your escape attempts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157550/extras/4de2a8dff0d877c4b58b8c610195ae31.poster.avif?t=1753473034\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157550/extras/4de2a8dff0d877c4b58b8c610195ae31.webm?t=1753473034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157550/extras/4de2a8dff0d877c4b58b8c610195ae31.mp4?t=1753473034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey will be difficult. The walls of Torment were not built to be breached.  It\u2019ll take all of your wits and a healthy dose of adaptability to be able to survive. And yet\u2026 there is hope. The Rogumon desire their freedom as much as you do, and they will join you if you call. Even the powerful foes who most fervently oppose you might be swayed, given enough time. Though you inevitably will fail, you\u2019ll find the means to strengthen your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is much to do. Let us begin.</p>","developers":["xalfer"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157550/header.jpg?t=1753473034","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04, Ubuntu 18.04, and CentOS 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 256 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+ or Vulkan-capable, Nvidia and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra 10.13+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 256 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal-capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 169 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Game is not notarized and may not work with Catalina.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3157550/1037186741/31d4d90